# Pencil design canvas. A ~1MB .pen JSON document (saved without the
# extension) that the Pencil MCP tools read and write in place — design
# source, not app source. Ignored so it can't be swept into a commit by
# `git add .`; do NOT move or delete it, the tools address it by this path.
/yoko

